                    <description>PWM period point trigger DAC function Enabled</description>
                    <value>#1</value>
                 </enumeratedValue>
              </enumeratedValues>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>CUTRGEN0</name>
              <description>PWM Compare Up Count Point Trigger DAC Enable Bits\nPWM can trigger DAC to start action when PWM counter counts up to CMP if this bit is set to1.\nNote 1: This bit should keep at 0 when PWM counter operating in down counter type.\nNote 2: In complementary mode, CUTRGEN1, 3, 5 is used as another CUTRGEN for channel 0, 2, 4.</description>
