              <description>EXTCMD3 Transmit Threshold Status\nThis bit is set when the number of empty locations in transmit buffer is greater than or equal to threshold value specified by by TXEBTH (I3C_EXTTHLD[18:16]) setting. \nThis bit is cleared automatically when number of empty locations in transmit buffer is less than threshold value specified.</description>
              <bitOffset>3</bitOffset>
