              <description>Port A-H Pin[n] Output Value\nEach of these bits controls the status of a Px.n pin when the Px.n is configured as Push-pull output, Open-drain output or Quasi-bidirectional mode.\nNote: For more information about Px.n, please refer to the 'PIN CONFIGURATION' chapter.</description>
