              <description>PWM Synchronous Start Function Enable Bit 0\nWhen synchronous start function is enabled, the PWM_CH0 counter enable bit (CNTEN0) can be enabled by writing PWM synchronous start trigger bit (CNTSEN). </description>
              <bitOffset>0</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
              <enumeratedValues>
                 <enumeratedValue>
