              <description>PWM Capture Falling Latch Interrupt Flag\nNote 1: When Capture with PDMA operating, CAPIF corresponding channel CFLIF will be cleared by hardware after PDMA transfer data.\nNote 2: This bit is cleared by writing 1 to it.</description>
